<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Hakkımda</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0d0d0d;
      --surface: #141414;
      --border: #222;
      --text: #e8e8e8;
      --muted: #555;
      --accent: #c8f542;
      --accent-dim: rgba(200, 245, 66, 0.08);
      --font: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--font);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.75;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 60px 24px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    /* Grain overlay */
    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noise'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noise)' opacity='0.04'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 640px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease both;
    }

    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* ── Header ── */
    header {
      margin-bottom: 56px;
    }

    .prompt {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .prompt span {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 6vw, 40px);
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    h1 em {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-style: normal;
    }

    .tagline {
      margin-top: 14px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      max-width: 400px;
    }

    /* ── Divider ── */
    .divider {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      margin: 32px 0;
    }

    /* ── Section ── */
    section {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease both;
    }

    section:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
    section:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
    section:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
    section:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }

    .section-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    p {
      color: #aaa;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      max-width: 560px;
    }

    /* ── Skills grid ── */
    .skills {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .skill-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 2px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #888;
      background: var(--surface);
      transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
      cursor: default;
    }

    .skill-tag:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: var(--accent);
      background: var(--accent-dim);
    }

    /* ── Experience list ── */
    .exp-list {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .exp-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      gap: 4px 16px;
      padding-bottom: 20px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .exp-item:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }

    .exp-role {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .exp-company {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .exp-year {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-align: right;
      padding-top: 2px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    /* ── Contact links ── */
    .contact-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .contact-link {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      color: #888;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 13px;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .contact-link::before {
      content: '→';
      color: var(--muted);
      transition: color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .contact-link:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .contact-link:hover::before {
      color: var(--accent);
      transform: translateX(4px);
    }

    /* ── Footer ── */
    footer {
      margin-top: 64px;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--muted);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .status {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .dot {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent);
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
      50%       { opacity: 0.3; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">

    <header>
      <p class="prompt"><span>~/hakkimda</span> $ whoami</p>
      <h1>Merhaba, ben <em>Adınız</em>.</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Yazılım geliştirici. Temiz kod yazmayı, sade tasarımı ve iyi kahveyi severim.</p>
    </header>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <section>
      <p class="section-label">// hakkımda</p>
      <p>
        İstanbul'da yaşayan, 5+ yıl deneyimli bir full-stack geliştiriciyim.
        Kullanıcı odaklı ürünler inşa etmekten, karmaşık problemleri basit çözümlere
        dönüştürmekten keyif alıyorum. Hem ön yüz hem de arka yüz tarafında rahatça çalışıyorum.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <p class="section-label">// yetenekler</p>
      <div class="skills">
        <span class="skill-tag">TypeScript</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">React</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Node.js</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Python</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">PostgreSQL</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Docker</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">REST API</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Git</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">CSS</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Linux</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <p class="section-label">// deneyim</p>
      <ul class="exp-list">
        <li class="exp-item">
          <div>
            <p class="exp-role">Senior Frontend Developer</p>
            <p class="exp-company">TechStudio A.Ş.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="exp-year">2022 — günümüz</p>
        </li>
        <li class="exp-item">
          <div>
            <p class="exp-role">Full-Stack Developer</p>
            <p class="exp-company">Dijital Ajans</p>
          </div>
          <p class="exp-year">2020 — 2022</p>
        </li>
        <li class="exp-item">
          <div>
            <p class="exp-role">Junior Developer</p>
            <p class="exp-company">StartupLab</p>
          </div>
          <p class="exp-year">2018 — 2020</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <p class="section-label">// iletişim</p>
      <div class="contact-links">
        <a class="contact-link" href="mailto:ornek@email.com">ornek@email.com</a>
        <a class="contact-link" href="https://github.com" target="_blank">github.com/kullaniciadi</a>
        <a class="contact-link" href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank">linkedin.com/in/kullaniciadi</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <span>© 2025 Adınız</span>
      <span class="status">
        <span class="dot"></span>
        Yeni fırsatlara açığım
      </span>
    </footer>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
